{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50137","headline":"杂诗 · 崔湜","name":"杂诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹊巢恶木巅，常窘一枝息；宁知猗（椅）[一]（原卷作「椅」）梧凤，亦欲此栖宿！喈喈多好音，矫矫奋轻翼，上林岂不成，（蒋礼鸿〖简称「蒋」〗、项楚〖简称「项」〗皆云：「成」当作「茂」。\n原卷作「茂」。\n）胡爲恋幽仄？\n处陋仍莫保，居华固陵偪，下流不可居[二]斯言可佩服。\n（[一]俞平伯先生云：「『猗梧』当作『椅梧』。\n《诗·定之方中》：『椅桐梓漆。\n』」[二]刘盼遂先生云：「司马迁《报任少卿书》云：负下未易居，下游多谤议，此合爲一句。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔湜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50137.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50137","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}